#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:32 143cde3106054faaacf9e8a4c3823bac
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search a curated registry of ~30 major longitudinal "
"cohort studies relevant to aging research worldwide. Contains study "
"metadata including design, sample size, age range, variable categories, "
"and data access information. Use to find the right cohort for a specific "
"research question, such as which studies measure iron intake, grip "
"strength, or walking speed in older adults. Filters by country, study "
"design (longitudinal/cross-sectional), minimum sample size, and specific "
"variable availability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:34 186863d148e84c1b9d70e03627f5a6af
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:36 38d0d09242814139988d6df300a6eb61
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Keyword search across study names, "
"descriptions, variable categories, and topics. Examples: 'iron intake "
"longitudinal', 'grip strength aging Europe', 'biomarkers elderly China'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:39 0da3b2b2e34b427b889975fda0be0815
msgid ""
"``country`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by country or region. "
"Examples: 'USA', 'UK', 'China', 'Europe', 'Netherlands'. Case-insensitive"
" substring match."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:42 753f4bd66ed14439af3c2d0eae587160
msgid ""
"``design`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by study design. One of: "
"'longitudinal', 'cross-sectional', 'both'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:45 184d234c60c741139640a03965ee967d
msgid ""
"``min_sample_size`` (integer, null) (optional) Minimum sample size "
"threshold. Only returns cohorts with sample\\_size >= this value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/aging_cohort_tools.rst:48 888ced2b4a3d4c60bb0bfe5f0f9bee3d
msgid ""
"``has_variable`` (string, null) (optional) Filter for cohorts that "
"include a specific variable category. Substring match against variable "
"categories. Examples: 'iron', 'grip\\_strength', 'walking\\_speed', "
"'nutrition', 'cognitive', 'biomarkers', 'genetics'."
msgstr ""

